== FriendlyError ==
"Failed to install app '896660' (Disk space)"	There isn't enough free disk space for the Valheim server (it needs about 2 GB).
"App '896660' state is 0x202 after update job."	There isn't enough free disk space for the Valheim server (it needs about 2 GB).
"Failed to install app '896660' (Disk write failure)"	SteamCMD couldn't write the server files. Make sure the disk isn't full and the server isn't running.
"App '896660' state is 0x602 after update job."	SteamCMD couldn't write the server files. Make sure the disk isn't full and the server isn't running.
"Timeout downloading item"	SteamCMD couldn't reach Steam. Check the internet connection and try again.
"Failed to install app '896660' (No connection)"	SteamCMD couldn't reach Steam. Check the internet connection and try again.
"Failed to connect"	SteamCMD couldn't reach Steam. Check the internet connection and try again.
"steamcmd: Bad CPU type in executable"	SteamCMD needs Rosetta on a Mac with Apple silicon. Open Terminal, run: softwareupdate --install-rosetta, then try again.
"App '896660' state is 0x6 after update job."	SteamCMD hit an error while updating (App '896660' state is 0x6 after update job.). Try again, or use Repair.
"Failed to install app '896660' (Invalid platform)"	SteamCMD reported an error: Failed to install app '896660' (Invalid platform)
"something nobody has seen"	SteamCMD reported an error: something nobody has seen
